   "message": "The site leaves out the hourly receipt folders, so it fits under the 1 GB Pages limit again (#795)\n\nThe site reached 1008 MB on 8 Nov 01:35 UTC and every deploy since was refused, so margin.wiki froze on that hour while collection kept running. data/corridor_receipts and data/provider_receipts are about 600 MB, grow about 50 MB a day, and no page opens them. They stay in the repo, where the number audit reads them.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVGgsNosa4c5zdXbTMr\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
